                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Pipeline Depth &amp; Issue Width</strong></td>
                  <td>7-to-10 Stage Superscalar (4-Wide Fetch, 3-Wide Decode/Rename/Commit)</td>
                  <td>Shatters the in-order single-issue IPC barrier, achieving sustained IPC &gt; 1.2 in complex workloads.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Register Renaming &amp; PRF</strong></td>
                  <td>Register Alias Table (RAT) &bull; 128-Entry Unified PRF</td>
                  <td>Completely eliminates false WAR and WAW register hazards across speculatively executed threads.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Reorder Buffer (RoB)</strong></td>
                  <td>128-Entry Circular Buffer (Commits up to 4 uOPs/cycle)</td>
                  <td>Maintains precise architectural exception state and single-cycle recovery on branch mispredictions.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Non-Blocking L1-D &amp; MSHRs</strong></td>
                  <td>32 KiB 8-Way VIPT Cache &bull; 8-Entry MSHR Queue</td>
                  <td>Hides DRAM latency by sustaining up to 8 concurrent outstanding memory misses without core stalls.</td>
                </tr>
